### Release note

- Provide settings to prefer index scan over table scan.

pr_comments:
for test cases, after enable `tidb_opt_prefer_range_scan`, we also need these:

1. queries which can not utilize any index, check whether a table full scan (not index full scan + table rowid scan) is chosen.
2. queries which can utilize more than one index, check whether the optimal index is chosen.
